Capability Catalog extension for Spec Kit.

The command structure, the rule-writing conventions, the retired-rule table, the
reserved file names and the propose-then-wait flow were adapted from
spec-kit-domain-spec by Jina Park (MIT License):
https://github.com/jinaparkdev/spec-kit-domain-spec

This extension deliberately does not adopt that project's authoring rule that
code wins when a document and the code disagree: here the catalog keeps the
approved requirement and implementation.md records what was observed.
